---
import config from "@/config/config.json";
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  description="Deep dive into the architectural principles, economic reasoning, and technical depth behind Sandikodev's engineering approach."
  meta_title={`Architectural Manifesto — ${config.metadata.meta_author}`}
>
  <div class="arch-root">
    <div class="arch-container">
      <header class="arch-header">
        <span class="depth-tag">
          <span class="teal">$</span> architectural --manifesto
        </span>
        <h1>Architectural Engineering</h1>
        <p class="arch-lead">
          Building software is easy. Engineering resilient, cost-effective, and
          secure systems that survive production for years is the real
          challenge. This is my blueprint.
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- ROI Section (Moved from Index) -->
      <section class="roi-section">
        <div class="roi-header">
          <h2>The Business Advantage</h2>
          <p>
            Technical depth isn't a vanity metric—it's an economic asset.
            Understanding the full stack from silicon to UI allows me to
            engineer value where others see only complexity.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="roi-grid">
          <div class="roi-card">
            <div class="roi-icon-wrapper">
              <svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2.5"
                ><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 000 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 010 7H6"
                ></path></svg
              >
            </div>
            <h3>Cost Engineering</h3>
            <p>
              I write code that respects OS-level resources. By optimizing at
              the kernel level and using efficient rendering strategies, I
              reduce your cloud bills before the code even ships.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="roi-card highlight-card">
            <div class="roi-icon-wrapper">
              <svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2.5"
                ><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"
                ></path></svg
              >
            </div>
            <h3>Security Hardening</h3>
            <p>
              Security isn't an afterthought. With a background in threat
              modelling and network security, I build systems that are hardened
              by default, protecting your data and reputation.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="roi-card">
            <div class="roi-icon-wrapper">
              <svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2.5"
                ><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"></path></svg
              >
            </div>
            <h3>Lean Execution</h3>
            <p>
              One engineer owning the full lifecycle. I handle Domain, TLS,
              Docker, CI/CD, and DB Schema. This removes communication debt and
              accelerates your time-to-market.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="manifesto-box">
          <p>
            "A great programmer writes code. An <strong
              >Architectural Engineer</strong
            >
            builds systems that stay resilient, secure, and cost-effective for years."
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Diff Section (Moved from Index) -->
      <section class="diff-section">
        <div class="roi-header">
          <span class="depth-tag">
            <span class="teal">$</span> diff average-dev.txt sandikodev.txt
          </span>
          <h2>What This Background Changes</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="diff-grid">
          <div class="roi-card">
            <div class="diff-icon">🔐</div>
            <h3>Security by Default</h3>
            <p>
              Having studied attack surfaces before building systems means
              security decisions are part of the design, not an afterthought. I
              think about threat models the same way I think about schema
              design.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="roi-card">
            <div class="diff-icon">📡</div>
            <h3>End-to-End Request Tracing</h3>
            <p>
              I can follow an HTTP request from the ethernet frame through NAT,
              firewall rules, load balancer, reverse proxy, application server,
              and down to the database query — and pinpoint where latency
              actually lives.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="roi-card">
            <div class="diff-icon">🏗️</div>
            <h3>Production Ownership</h3>
            <p>
              I've been the person on-call when things break at 2am. That
              experience directly influences how I write code — with
              observability, graceful degradation, and operational cost built
              into the design from day one.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="roi-card highlight-card">
            <div class="diff-icon">⚡</div>
            <h3>Full-Stack in the Literal Sense</h3>
            <p>
              Domain setup, TLS cert, Docker deployment, CI/CD pipeline, API
              design, database schema, and the final pixel in the UI — I've
              shipped all of it solo. Useful for startups and small teams that
              need fewer handoffs.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Deeper Insight -->
      <section class="insight-section">
        <div class="insight-grid">
          <div class="insight-text">
            <h3>Philosophy: Bare Metal to UI</h3>
            <p>
              My journey started in 2009, tinkering with Pentium 2 systems.
              Understanding how electrons flow and how packets are routed gave
              me a perspective most developers miss.
            </p>
            <p>
              I don't just use frameworks; I understand the rendering engines,
              the garbage collection cycles, and the tcp handshake latency that
              makes them feel "slow".
            </p>
            <div class="insight-cta">
              <a href="/v0" class="v0-link">
                <span class="teal">Explore Archive</span>
                <span>— See the evolution from 2009-2025</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="insight-visual">
            <div class="stack-box">
              <div class="stack-label">THE BLUEPRINT</div>
              <div class="stack-item"><span>User Experience</span></div>
              <div class="stack-item">
                <span>Performance Architecture</span>
              </div>
              <div class="stack-item"><span>Security Infrastructure</span></div>
              <div class="stack-item"><span>Core Logic</span></div>
              <div class="stack-item"><span>Bare Metal / Cloud</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .arch-root {
    background: var(--color-bg);
    padding: 6rem 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  .arch-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .arch-header {
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .depth-tag {
    font-family: "Fira Code", monospace;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .teal {
    color: #4ecdc4;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .arch-lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  /* ROI Styles (Refined) */
  .roi-section {
    margin-bottom: 6rem;
  }

  .roi-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .roi-header h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .roi-header p {
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    opacity: 0.7;
    max-width: 600px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .roi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .roi-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .roi-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .roi-icon-wrapper {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background: rgba(78, 205, 196, 0.1);
    color: #4ecdc4;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .roi-icon-wrapper svg {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
  }

  .roi-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
  }

  .roi-card p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    opacity: 0.7;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .highlight-card {
    border-color: rgba(78, 205, 196, 0.3);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(78, 205, 196, 0.03), transparent);
  }

  .manifesto-box {
    border-left: 4px solid #4ecdc4;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
  }

  .manifesto-box p {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  /* Insight Section */
  .insight-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-top: 4rem;
  }

  .insight-text h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .insight-text p {
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    opacity: 0.7;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .insight-cta {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .v0-link {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-decoration: none;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .v0-link:hover {
    border-color: #4ecdc4;
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .v0-link span:first-child {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .v0-link span:last-child {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .stack-box {
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01);
  }

  .stack-label {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .stack-item {
    padding: 1rem;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .stack-item:first-of-type {
    border-color: rgba(78, 205, 196, 0.3);
    color: #4ecdc4;
  }

  .diff-section {
    margin-bottom: 6rem;
    padding-top: 4rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .diff-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .diff-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .roi-grid,
    .insight-grid,
    .diff-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
